   "widgets_values": [
    "⚗ ALCHEMICA — CALIBRATED PHOTO, TWO STAGES\n\nRun KREA2_TARATURA (calibration) first, then pick the profile in the\nsampler ('profilo' menu). It also works without a profile: it falls back\nto alchemica_duale and default values (the report says so).\n\n-1 values in the purple nodes = 'measured by the profile':\nhand-off sigma between the two stages, restart sigma, detail window.\n\nThe purple option nodes OVERRIDE the preset: disconnect 'opts' from the\nsampler to use the pure preset.\n\nNo FaceDetailer, no tiles: the second stage already draws at 3 MP.\nCheck it yourself with KREA2_ALCHEMICA_CONFRONTO on full figures."
   ],
   "title": "⚗ AlchemicaMente · notes"
